      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Start with 6 dc in a magic ring using brown yarn. Increase to 12 dc over two rounds, then work one straight round. Fasten off with a long tail and do not stuff."
